@startuml

title Publishing a derived market object: compute, raise, decide, apply

actor "Trader\n(maker)" as maker
participant "Market data" as md
participant "Inbox\n(library, same database)" as inbox
actor "Decider\n(checker)" as checker
participant "Readers" as readers

== Compute ==
maker -> md : compute(subject, as-of)
md -> md : solve and check; store the candidate\nwith its lineage, inputs and checks\n(an unchanged compute converges\non the existing version)
md --> maker : candidate version and its checks

== Raise ==
maker -> md : raise publish(subject, as-of, reason)
md -> md : the subject is the session party's;\nno blocking check failed;\nno open request for it;\nnot older than the live set
md -> inbox : read the kind, the approvals mode\nand the provisioning grants\n(before the transaction, tenant-wide)
inbox --> md : the rule in force, if any
group one transaction
  md -> inbox : write the request (and its rule)
  md -> md : write the subject:\nsubject, as-of, candidate version
  opt a stated rule closes it
    inbox -> inbox : approve, decided by the system
    md -> md : apply (below), in this transaction
  end
end
alt closed by a rule
  md --> maker : published
else a person decides
  md --> maker : raised; waits on the decision
  inbox -> checker : a request waits
  checker -> inbox : approve (not the maker)
  inbox -> maker : the request is approved
  maker -> md : apply(request), within the apply window
end

== Apply ==
md -> md : the request is of the kind, approved,\nin its window, not applied; the subject\nmatches; the candidate is the version\napproved; no input was withdrawn;\nno newer set is live
group one transaction
  md -> md : publish the set; stamp publisher and instant
  md -> md : supersede the sets it replaces
  md -> md : write the notice (outbox row)
end
md -> readers : deliver the notice after the commit\n(retried until delivered)
md --> maker : published

@enduml
